Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:12.78,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是照著以前的習慣在活著
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.36,0:00:17.27,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}起床
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.59,0:00:19.03,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外出工作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:20.73,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吃飯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:21.96,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}睡覺
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.19,0:00:25.75,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}僅僅是重複著身體已經記住了的動作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.81,0:00:28.51,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直過著這樣的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:36.25,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彷彿折磨自己一樣一直工作著
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.35,0:00:43.77,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為了忘記那一切 不顧一切地工作著
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:49.32,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎君 今天就到這吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:51.80,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 馬上就做完了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:55.77,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然很感謝你幫我做了不少東西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:00:59.19,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你這樣工作小心身體吃不消哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.51,0:01:02.09,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你連盂蘭盆節也沒休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.15,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒事 我是因為喜歡才在做的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.97,0:01:10.17,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不偶爾休息一下的話 有關部門會來囉唆的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:18.08,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下班後的時間和節假日過得很痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.62,0:01:22.30,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}僅是為了打發時間而把錢花掉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:28.74,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是投身現實的話 感覺一切都會坍塌下來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.71,0:01:33.11,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我討厭這個小鎮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:38.80,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而除了這個小鎮我也再無棲身之所
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.13,0:01:42.47,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只能宛如行屍走肉般地活著
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:07.34,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼也不願去想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.51,0:02:10.37,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想要把一切都忘掉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.61,0:02:15.26,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}認為一切都是錯誤的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.67,0:02:26.63,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}與她的相遇 交往 結婚 生子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:31.40,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}認為這一切的一切都是錯誤的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:13.74,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果通過發自內心的希望能使這些廢品成型的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.35,0:04:16.07,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是我一個人無法辦到的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.52,0:04:20.34,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這件事我是知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.65,0:04:22.50,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.81,0:04:27.95,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為我不是人類
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.75,0:04:39.00,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在哭嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:43.33,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想起傷心的事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.39,0:04:47.45,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這個世界很讓人悲傷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:54.59,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很快這裡就會變成一片雪白了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.18,0:05:02.31,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我動不了了的話 就會讓你變得孤單一人了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:27.35,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.27,0:05:30.16,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}午安 朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.48,0:05:31.31,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早苗阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:34.26,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 打擾你休息了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:35.89,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:37.39,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一個人來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:40.10,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我一個人來的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:42.60,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請稍等片刻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:45.44,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}屋裡有點亂 我收拾一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:54.64,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天還真是熱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.87,0:05:59.54,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣可不行哦 偶爾也得出去透透氣才行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:03.67,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 芳野先生也經常這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.77,0:06:06.91,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 這麼熱的天一個人出門也…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:09.25,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那跟我去約會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:14.69,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了啊 忽然之間
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.13,0:06:16.20,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:19.59,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我偶爾也想和年輕人約約會
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:23.64,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼不用找我 找其他人也行的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.74,0:06:24.83,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.99,0:06:29.39,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也既帥又溫柔 是我最中意的類型呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.99,0:06:31.14,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才沒有這樣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:33.64,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我還總依靠著早苗阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:42.60,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}變化…好大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.75,0:06:45.15,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不常來車站這邊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:47.58,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 不常來這邊的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.59,0:06:55.71,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這個夏天 朋也你能抽出個連休嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:07:00.50,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公司那邊還總說我該去休息一下了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:03.62,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那要不要出去玩玩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.93,0:07:05.37,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就我們倆嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.72,0:07:07.42,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那可真叫人心跳呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:09.19,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那樣也不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:12.35,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但這次我們大家一起出去玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:14.18,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:15.83,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 大家一起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:20.70,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}媽媽 快點來喝果汁啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:24.10,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可以這樣哦 會打攪到別人的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.83,0:07:31.04,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一起去吧 秋生也好久沒能和朋也喝上一杯了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:32.86,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:34.68,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一起去吧 好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.68,0:07:37.99,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讓我考慮一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:51.37,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是早苗 旅行的事考慮好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:54.20,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 那個 還沒想好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.31,0:07:57.05,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼我一會兒再打給你好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.14,0:08:01.77,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼催得這麼緊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:05.70,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.76,0:08:07.79,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:11.63,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早苗阿姨 我敗給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.91,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 你答應了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:17.39,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 下週我會去向公司請假
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:20.73,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算上週日 湊成四連休
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.05,0:08:22.64,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}謝謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:31.63,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說實話 我很迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:34.36,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但這個時候再拒絕的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:36.65,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就好像背叛了早苗阿姨似的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:42.24,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本來就把一切都推給她了的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:53.38,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:56.71,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早苗阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:01.64,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:15.99,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}致朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:21.90,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為有急事 我和秋生一起出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.32,0:09:24.56,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}剩下的事情就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:30.71,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}騙人的吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.98,0:09:56.82,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:18.00,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:56.04,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂喂 不用這麼緊張 出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:02.94,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早苗阿姨和大叔都出去了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.58,0:11:04.19,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:06.77,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早苗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:09.80,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是都說了嗎 早苗阿姨不在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:11.59,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿秋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.97,0:11:13.55,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大叔也不在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:23.30,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他們臨走時沒對你交代什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.95,0:11:27.01,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.79,0:11:30.27,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想去旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:34.57,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這不可能 因為早苗阿姨和大叔都不在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:37.16,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還是說你想一個人去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:40.37,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想和早苗和阿秋一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.98,0:11:42.53,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都說了這不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.49,0:12:00.46,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這算是什麼狀況啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.21,0:12:11.51,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這五年間 我把汐完全推給了早苗阿姨和大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:16.85,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}連幼兒園的入園典禮和七五三節都無視 一直工作著
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:16.85,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fs48\an8}七五三節：男孩三歲、五歲或女孩三歲、七歲時在11月15日去神社參拜,祈求健康成長
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.92,0:12:21.63,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然早苗阿姨有時會把汐帶到我那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.31,0:12:24.23,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我都沒怎麼正眼看過她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.26,0:12:28.90,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.13,0:12:35.79,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是想躲起來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:37.11,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早就看見了的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.58,0:12:39.90,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到這邊來 別站在那裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:50.56,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.23,0:12:54.12,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算了 不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.33,0:13:00.63,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想呢 大叔和早苗阿姨大概到晚上就會回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:04.23,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以今天就乖乖等著吧 知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.17,0:13:06.10,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.07,0:13:10.14,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等大叔和早苗阿姨回來後就能去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:12.33,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天你就一個人玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:13.42,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.26,0:13:18.22,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看上去像個男孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.61,0:13:22.16,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:31.03,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.15,0:13:32.67,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}誰讓你跑得那麼快
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.42,0:13:34.48,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒有受傷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:36.64,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看上去好像沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.79,0:13:37.79,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以後要小心一點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:55.64,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在玩這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.85,0:13:56.44,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.18,0:14:00.53,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}掉到地上的時候摔壞了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.64,0:14:03.72,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小烏龜好可憐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:10.68,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有黏合劑的話應該能修好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.34,0:14:14.46,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等著 我去把它黏好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.13,0:14:34.57,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然還有點裂痕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.83,0:14:36.37,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但也不是很顯眼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.63,0:14:40.19,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在它乾之前不要去動它
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.61,0:14:42.31,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然輪子也會被黏住
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:46.26,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她聽懂我說的話了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.51,0:14:48.58,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算了 不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.26,0:14:59.11,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:01.51,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不會動了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:07.43,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 你把這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.02,0:15:10.51,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是說過在它乾之前不要動它的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.85,0:15:13.45,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這個輪子已經動不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:15.14,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}修不好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:17.36,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已經修不好了 放棄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.90,0:15:19.54,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼辦 要扔掉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.64,0:15:23.86,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.90,0:15:33.88,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還有什麼事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:35.96,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早苗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.35,0:15:38.59,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.34,0:15:40.86,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還沒回來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.26,0:15:42.96,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.12,0:15:49.38,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肚子餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.65,0:15:55.07,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去買點什麼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.55,0:15:56.90,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有什麼想吃的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:15:59.74,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒有的話 我就隨便買了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.47,0:16:08.75,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀 岡崎先生 好久不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.15,0:16:10.10,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唔 您好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.67,0:16:12.33,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真好啊 小汐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.54,0:16:14.55,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天和爸爸出來買東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.26,0:16:17.19,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什麼時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.86,0:16:21.43,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們現在是分開住的吧 也真難為你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:26.14,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一個大男人 要自己把小孩拉扯大是很辛苦的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.01,0:16:28.88,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你們時常有見面的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.35,0:16:31.29,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 偶爾會
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.69,0:16:34.61,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然不見面的話會很寂寞的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:37.57,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎麼說 畢竟是父女嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.21,0:16:39.75,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說 說的是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.49,0:16:44.89,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼小汐 拜拜了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:02.29,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}給 吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.11,0:17:07.98,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了 你自己會吃的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:11.76,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:27.13,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好苦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.49,0:17:28.30,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苦？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.35,0:17:35.49,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是胡椒的關係嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:38.86,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 沒這個的話就不能叫炒飯了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.86,0:17:40.11,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忍耐著吃下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.29,0:17:40.98,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:45.56,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂喂 早苗阿姨沒對你說過不可以挑食的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:49.49,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想吃早苗做的飯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.61,0:17:51.76,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你就別吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.40,0:18:05.07,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒胡椒就行了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:05.99,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.06,0:18:09.09,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是沒胡椒的話會很難吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:10.24,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白米飯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.80,0:18:11.31,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白米飯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.78,0:18:13.03,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只吃白米飯就行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.49,0:18:14.07,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:17.00,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那樣的話我倒省事了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.89,0:18:18.39,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}給
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:23.70,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把炒飯當做白米飯的菜 真是奇怪的菜單
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:25.08,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:26.93,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.45,0:18:28.20,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要這個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:33.44,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒有菜的話 就好像我是在虐待你似的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.99,0:18:48.11,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拌飯料嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:54.05,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.39,0:19:07.28,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天不會回來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:29.40,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}起來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.08,0:19:32.08,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想尿尿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:33.85,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:45.95,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一個人做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:47.74,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是當然的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.25,0:20:06.76,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.09,0:20:07.80,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.22,0:20:09.32,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這次是大的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.69,0:20:10.79,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:31.33,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一個人做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:33.73,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用每次都來向我炫耀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.73,0:20:35.54,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也能一個人辦到的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.90,0:20:45.57,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想去旅行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:46.78,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:50.07,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我們兩個人去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.68,0:20:52.39,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.27,0:20:55.54,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你願意嗎 和我一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.04,0:20:58.19,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早苗阿姨和大叔都不在哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:21:00.65,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 他們都不回來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:04.29,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 他們都不回來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.45,0:21:05.16,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:08.69,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼就我們兩個人去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:10.42,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.33,0:21:21.63,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒有忘帶東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.75,0:21:22.27,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.88,0:21:24.09,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}門窗鎖好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.37,0:21:24.84,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.33,0:21:26.90,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 出發
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.30,0:21:28.63,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.27,0:21:39.11,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前每次見到汐的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.31,0:21:41.53,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}總是會有早苗阿姨或者大叔在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.93,0:21:44.93,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們像這樣兩個人單獨在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.19,0:21:49.11,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自從汐誕生之後 這五年以來還是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.03,0:22:01.67,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們將前往哪裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.86,0:23:44.49,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.14,0:23:47.03,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稍微考慮一下周圍的人好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.74,0:23:48.35,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}媽媽…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.55,0:23:49.14,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.87,0:23:53.20,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說你啊 想上廁所的話先說一聲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.56,0:23:55.32,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.09,0:02:54.56,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)\bord0\blur10\t(0,1000,1,\blur0)}{\1c&H040404&}在那坡道的中途 你漸漸遠去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.59,0:02:54.56,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)\bord2\be3\1a&HFF&}{\1c&H040404&\3c&HA4A09F&}在那坡道的中途 你漸漸遠去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:03:00.28,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&HC380B8&\3c&HF2E3FA&}溫暖的夕陽 留下了無數珍貴的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:05.31,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H5F2536&\3c&HB083B7&}{\t(392,433,1,\1c&H8E6B6C&\3c&HDAC0B8&)}只留我獨自一人　在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:13.09,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H8E6B6C&\3c&HDAC0B8&)}{\t(458,917,1,\1c&H4B251B&\3c&H7D645E&)}{\t(1626,2002,1,\1c&H9C6687&\3c&HE8D9F0&)}{\t(2460,2752,1,\1c&HC9838A&\3c&HE6C6C9&)}{\t(3713,4004,1,\1c&H93464D&\3c&HF7C8C2&)}{\t(5297,5881,1,\1c&H1C8AF6&\3c&HBCD8F9&)}用思念回憶著　這份溫暖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.24,0:03:20.79,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H3B343E&\3c&HE2EDF5&}{\t(320,361,1,\1c&H3D464A&\3c&H408141&)}{\t(778,1738,1,\1c&HC28147&\3c&HE9B997&)}{\t(2614,3781,1,\1c&H625A2B&\3c&HA7C08C&)}{\t(4324,4365,1,\1c&H8C77C0&\3c&HC5BBE9&)}{\t(5825,5867,1,\1c&HE96B0E&\3c&HF4AD4F&)}唯有你　唯有你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.87,0:03:27.00,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H7C2506&\3c&HD76923&}{\t(1782,2950,1,\1c&H5C3C08&\3c&HA09D6D&)}{\t(3534,3575,1,\1c&H6C5C6B&\3c&HB8A5B1&)}{\t(4827,4868,1,\1c&H7C2506&\3c&HD76923&)}我一直喜歡著你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.09,0:03:34.60,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H7C2506&\3c&HD76923&}{\t(776,817,1,\1c&H5F4E46&\3c&HA49288&)}{\t(858,1883,1,\1c&H459BEF&\3c&H60C2F6&)}{\t(2611,3779,1,\1c&H554E76&\3c&H9EA6DC&)}{\t(4237,4279,1,\1c&H459BEF&\3c&H60C2F6&)}{\t(5739,5781,1,\1c&H4F4753&\3c&H9F76A6&)}風沙起　眼迷離
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.85,0:03:41.72,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}{\be3\1c&H63594E&\3c&H8A8378&}{\t(1776,2944,1,\1c&H723F44&\3c&H6A515F&)}{\t(3320,3361,1,\1c&H7F4B3B&\3c&HBC9483&)}{\t(4654,4696,1,\1c&H673320&\3c&HCC9A80&)}{\t(5820,5812,1,\1c&HC1785B&\3c&HD2C1B4&)}{\t(6072,6114,1,\1c&H5F70B8&\3c&HD2C1B4&)}{\t(6323,6364,1,\1c&HA3E1F0&\3c&HD2C1B4&)}{\t(6614,6656,1,\1c&H7899D3&\3c&H95BDF7&)}你漸漸遠去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:43.89,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H102505&\3c&H5EA748&}{\t(830,1206,1,\1c&H545355&\3c&HA5897C&)}無論何時　都會銘記
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:46.05,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H7E86DE&\3c&HA9B4F5&}{\t(951,1326,1,\1c&H646048&\3c&HAB927B&)}即便世間　斗轉星移
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:48.28,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&HA04C67&\3c&H6992CA&}{\t(835,1210,1,\1c&H7D788D&\3c&HCECFDD&)}唯有那件　唯有那件
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:50.65,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H445055&\3c&H6E8284&}{\t(815,1190,1,\1c&HF19E3C&\3c&HF4E4BB&)}日常之事　不曾改變
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.65,0:03:52.77,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&HB28374&\3c&HEFE6E2&}看一看吧　那些光輝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:54.93,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&HB28374&\3c&HEFE6E2&}願望實現　唯有一件
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.93,0:03:57.04,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&HB28374&\3c&HEFE6E2&}無論何時　無論何時
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:04:00.51,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1400)}{\be3\1c&HB28374&\3c&HEFE6E2&}都在守護著
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:09.82,EDTC,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.77,0:22:25.84,EDTC,,0,0,0,,{\be18\fad(200,200)}凝望著朵朵流逝的雲彩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.23,0:22:32.82,EDTC,,0,0,0,,{\be18\fad(200,200)}感受著變化無窮的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:41.02,EDTC,,0,0,0,,{\be18\fad(200,200)}駐足而立的我們察覺到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.30,0:22:48.02,EDTC,,0,0,0,,{\be18\fad(200,200)}這不斷變遷的世界編織出的歌曲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.41,0:22:55.53,EDTC,,0,0,0,,{\be18\fad(200,200)}彷彿伸出手來追尋一般
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.89,0:23:03.36,EDTC,,0,0,0,,{\be18\fad(200,200)}去尋找那恆久不變的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.60,0:23:11.63,EDTC,,0,0,0,,{\be18\1c&HF0E0FF&\3c&HD9A9DB&\fad(200,200)}手裡高舉著的火炬
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.99,0:23:19.31,EDTC,,0,0,0,,{\be18\fad(200,200)}是通向明天的小小路標
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.49,0:23:26.46,EDTC,,0,0,0,,{\be18\fad(200,200)}現在依然明亮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.92,0:23:34.03,EDTC,,0,0,0,,{\be18\fad(200,200)}那一天的言語化為誓約
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.40,0:23:38.80,EDTC,,0,0,0,,{\be18\fad(200,200)}激勵我們前進
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.32,0:23:57.32,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,
